        "title": "交通",
        "slug": "access",
        "html": "<div class=\"av-layout-tab-inner\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-3nqeop-34d9e65624770abc0d991b3618a09a83 av-special-heading-h6 custom-color-heading  avia-builder-el-19  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first  av-linked-heading'><h6 class='av-special-heading-tag'  itemprop=\"headline\"  >交通</h6><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"></div></div></div>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-3jviop-e83f192b7d8dbd695261e769e30f021b'  itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><section id=\"catch\">\n<div class=\"catch_wrap\">\n<h2 class=\"mb03\"></h2>\n<div id=\"third-block\" class=\"mb04 inbl ver-top\">\n<div id=\"googlemap-area\" class=\"inbl-box\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d169059.00087574255!2d140.52779338937896!3d42.87705529737681!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x5f0aa5610901e4d5%3A0x53263f0ee24c1c64!2z44OL44K744Kz44Ki44Oz44OM44OX44Oq5Zu96Zqb44K544Kt44O85aC0!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1459399038183\" width=\"375\" height=\"293\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<hr />\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"mb04 inbl ver-top\"> <span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;\">車</span></h3>\n<div id=\"access-area\" class=\"inbl-box ml03\">\n<ul class=\"ls-none ma00 pa00\">\n<li>從札幌經R230（中山峠）約2小時，約110公里</li>\n<li>●從小樽出發經R5約1小時30分鐘、約80km</li>\n<li>從新千歲機場經R276（美富峠）約2小時、約110公里</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3 class=\"access-font mt02 mb01\">公共汽車</h3>\n<ul class=\"ls-none ma00 pa00\">\n<li>● 從札幌出發約3小時40分鐘</li>\n<li>● 距離小樽約2小時</li>\n<li>● 從新千歲機場出發約2小時56分鐘</li>\n<li>*營業時間可能會發生變化。詳情請提前聯繫我們。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3 class=\"mt02 mb01\">火車</h3>\n<ul class=\"ls-none ma00 pa00\">\n<li>從 JR 新雪谷站乘坐巴士或出租車約 10 分鐘</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"seaching inbl-box mt06\">\n<p class=\"nadare-font\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/%E3%83%8B%E3%82%BB%E3%82%B3%E3%82%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8C%E3%83%97%E3%83%AA%E5%9B%BD%E9%9A%9B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AD%E3%83%BC%E5%A0%B4/@42.847446,140.648031,10z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0x53263f0ee24c1c64?hl=ja\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">詳細路線搜索&gt;&gt;&gt;</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<article>\n<section id=\"bus\" class=\"access_content\"></section>\n</article>\n</div></section>\n</div></div>"
